f electrical myotonia in the ADR mouse: role of chloride conductance in myotubes and neonatal animals. <source>Neuromuscul. Disord.</source> <volume>3</volume>:<fpage>267</fpage>&#x02013;274.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8268723</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>